# Files / globs ignored by helper scripts that drive clang-tidy.
#
# Note: clang-tidy itself does not consume this file; tooling (run-clang-tidy,
# scripts/format-code.sh, CI workflows) reads it to skip generated and
# third-party sources. Use shell-style globs.

# FetchContent dependencies (googletest, spdlog, google benchmark, ...)
*/_deps/*

# Build trees
*/build/*
*/build-*/*
